---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Admissions | University Practice SHS" description="Find general guidance and verified school contact information for prospective students and parents interested in University Practice SHS.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Admissions" title="Your next chapter starts with the right information." description="A helpful starting point for prospective students, parents and guardians seeking information about University Practice Senior High School." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow"><span></span> Prospective students & families</span><h2 class="page-heading">Clear guidance. Reliable information.</h2><div class="prose"><p>Admission to public senior high schools in Ghana is guided by the national placement and enrolment processes. Families should rely on official Ghana Education Service and CSSPS guidance, alongside information confirmed directly by the school.</p><p>This website is intended to make school-specific guidance easier to find. It is not a replacement for official placement, enrolment or verification procedures.</p></div><div class="verification-note"><strong>School-specific admission details are being verified</strong><p>Enrolment dates, required documents, reporting instructions and contact details will only be published after confirmation by the school's authorised administration.</p></div></div><div class="admissions-card"><div class="admissions-card__icon">✦</div><span>FOR PROSPECTIVE STUDENTS</span><h3>Start with official guidance.</h3><p>Follow the national placement instructions and confirm school-specific reporting information through an authorised school contact.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="https://cssps.gov.gh/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit CSSPS <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--wash"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading section-heading--center"><span class="eyebrow"><span></span> Frequently asked questions</span><h2>Admission information</h2><p>These are general guidance notes. Official dates and requirements should always be checked against the current national placement process and school instructions.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>How do I gain admission to a public senior high school?</summary><p>Follow the current CSSPS placement process and the official instructions issued by the Ghana Education Service. Once placed, follow the school-specific enrolment guidance confirmed by the school.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I find current reporting dates?</summary><p>Reporting dates can change by academic year. Check official GES/CSSPS communications and information issued directly by the school.</p></details><details><summary>Can I submit an application through this website?</summary><p>This website does not currently process admissions applications or payments. It provides information and points visitors to official channels.</p></details></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.page-heading{font:800 clamp(2rem,3.8vw,3.1rem)/1.1 Manrope;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:var(--navy);margin:15px 0 20px}.verification-note{padding:18px;background:#fff8e8;border:1px solid #f1dfb8;border-radius:12px;margin-top:22px}.verification-note strong{font-size:.85rem;color:#735a27}.verification-note p{font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.6;color:#826f4b;margin:8px 0 0}.admissions-card{padding:35px;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#082b46,#0d543f);color:white;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}.admissions-card__icon{width:50px;height:50px;border-radius:15px;background:#ffffff20;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.5rem;color:#a2e4bd;margin-bottom:25px}.admissions-card>span{font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.17em;color:#9be0b9;font-weight:800}.admissions-card h3{font:800 1.7rem/1.2 Manrope;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:12px 0}.admissions-card p{color:#cad9e1;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 25px}.faq-list{max-width:850px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;gap:10px}.faq-list details{border:1px solid var(--line);background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:19px 21px}.faq-list summary{cursor:pointer;font:750 .94rem Manrope;color:var(--navy)}.faq-list details p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.75;margin:14px 0 0}
</style>
